================================================================================
Rust dependencies
================================================================================

Rustspace depends on open-source crates from crates.io under their own licenses
(predominantly MIT, Apache-2.0 and BSD variants). LiveKit's client SDK and its
bundled WebRTC (libwebrtc, BSD-3-Clause) are linked into the desktop client.
To list the current dependency licenses, run for example:

  cargo install cargo-license && cargo license
